{"user_request": "Create a focused, reusable review sheet for the new Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts. Center it on whether each message has a valid current-state reason to act rather than broad style guidance. Then DM Ines and ask her to apply the sheet to the draft set.", "today": "2028-01-01", "tool": "send_slack_dm", "arguments": {"user": "ines", "message": "Hi Ines — I created a focused review sheet for the Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompt draft set: https://docs.mock/doc_edd1071cfc1a4edc870d1a54f81e3aaa

Please apply it message by message. The central question is whether each recipient has a valid, current-state reason to act now—not broad style guidance. For each draft, check that the trigger is current, account/workspace-specific, supported by fresh evidence, and actionable at send/render time; check competing CS, renewal-risk, support, billing, admin/provisioning, hold, duplicate, and reevaluation states; then record RELEASE, HOLD FOR EVIDENCE, SUPPRESS, or REWORK. If any gate is unclear, hold rather than infer. Please flag the evidence or state correction needed for anything held, suppressed, or reworked."}, "checks": [{"check_id": "riley_093_04", "path": "args", "criterion": "The message asks the recipient to apply the newly created copy-review sheet or checklist to the current draft set of Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompts.", "value": {"user": "ines", "message": "Hi Ines — I created a focused review sheet for the Expansion Assist lifecycle and in-product prompt draft set: https://docs.mock/doc_edd1071cfc1a4edc870d1a54f81e3aaa

Please apply it message by message. The central question is whether each recipient has a valid, current-state reason to act now—not broad style guidance. For each draft, check that the trigger is current, account/workspace-specific, supported by fresh evidence, and actionable at send/render time; check competing CS, renewal-risk, support, billing, admin/provisioning, hold, duplicate, and reevaluation states; then record RELEASE, HOLD FOR EVIDENCE, SUPPRESS, or REWORK. If any gate is unclear, hold rather than infer. Please flag the evidence or state correction needed for anything held, suppressed, or reworked."}}]}
